WEBVTT

00:11:59.803 --> 00:12:03.247
So the casual uses
will be no longer that useful.

00:12:03.271 --> 00:12:05.683
So one could assume

00:12:05.707 --> 00:12:09.850
maybe fewer people would or should
learn foreign languages,

00:12:09.874 --> 00:12:13.418
because these magical
translators will be around.

00:12:13.442 --> 00:12:14.601
But on the other hand,

00:12:14.625 --> 00:12:19.760
if we believe AI will take care
of a lot of boring, routine jobs,

00:12:19.784 --> 00:12:21.472
we'll have more time on our hands,

00:12:21.496 --> 00:12:26.083
so maybe someone should learn Chinese
in order to read Confucius,

00:12:26.107 --> 00:12:31.593
or just as people learn Latin
in order to read the classics,